-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §86: a non-academic principal of §75(א) or
-- (ג) who completed a degree is placed on the academic principals' table —
-- the coefficient the full Y times the grade steps (§83) times the
-- degree's addition (5%, 15%, 25%); A = X on the move × it; at the current
-- level, the grade nearest at or above; the personal supplement recomputed
-- on that coefficient; and a complexity supplement of §67 kept.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
§ `86 שיבוץ בטבלת השכר של מנהלים אקדמאיים`

-- akn:art_86 The opening: who (§75(א) or (ג)), and the steps (א)–(ה).

DECLARE `non-academic principal's rank` IS ONE OF
    `a senior certified principal`
    `a certified principal`
    `an uncertified principal`

@ref akn:art_86__para_a akn:art_86__para_a/p2 akn:art_86__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_86__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_86__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN r IS A `non-academic principal's rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a principal's degree addition` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `a senior certified principal` THEN 5%
    WHEN `a certified principal` THEN 15%
    WHEN `an uncertified principal` THEN 25%

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `step of each grade` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      r IS A `non-academic principal's rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a principal's coefficient to the B.A. table` y `step of each grade` r IS
    (1 PLUS y)
        TIMES product (map (GIVEN s YIELD 1 PLUS s) `step of each grade`)
        TIMES (1 PLUS `a principal's degree addition` r)

-- (ב): A = X × the coefficient (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_86__para_b akn:art_86__para_b/p2
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, coefficient IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a principal's A to the B.A. table` x coefficient IS
    x TIMES coefficient

-- (ג): at the school's current level, §71's placement.
@ref akn:art_86__para_c
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER, `row of the current level` IS A LIST OF `grade cell`
GIVETH A MAYBE `grade cell`
DECIDE `a principal's placement after the degree` a `row of the current level` IS
    `the placement in the row` a `row of the current level`

-- (ד): the personal supplement of §72 recomputed with this coefficient;
-- (ה): a complexity supplement under §67 goes on.
@ref akn:art_86__para_d akn:art_86__para_e
GIVEN `had a complexity supplement under §67` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `keeps the complexity supplement after the placement` `had a complexity supplement under §67` IF
    `had a complexity supplement under §67`

#ASSERT `a principal's degree addition` `a certified principal` EQUALS 15%
